 shrink-0 inline-flex duration-150 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-current focus-visible:outline-offset-2 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap bg-brand-500 font-bold h-11 hover:bg-brand-600 px-5 rounded-button shadow-button text-sm text-surface 2xl:h-12 2xl:px-6 2xl:text-base md:self-auto self-start md:mt-2" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Try Scrapingdog for Free</a></div><ul class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-rows-[1fr_auto] sm:gap-5"><li class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border-soft bg-surface gap-4 lg:grid lg:grid-rows-subgrid lg:row-span-2 overflow-hidden p-5 relative sm:p-6"><span class="absolute pointer-events-none right-3 sm:right-4 -top-1 font-bold leading-none select-none text-brand-500/15" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:5rem;letter-spacing:-.04em">01</span><div class="flex flex-col relative gap-2.5"><h3 class="text-ink font-bold text-balance leading-[1.3] pr-12 sm:pr-14 sm:text-xl text-lg">You Keep Getting Blocked</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-soft text-pretty leading-[1.55]">Websites detect bots quickly, and suddenly your requests stop working. You keep getting blocked again and again, and it gets frustrating.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 p-4 bg-brand-50/60 border-brand-500 border-l-2 relative rounded-xl sm:p-4.5"><span class="items-center pl-1 bg-brand-500 font-bold gap-2 inline-flex pr-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] text-surface tracking-[0.12em] uppercase w-fit"><span class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-surface text-brand-500 h-5 w-5"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-3 w-3"><use href="#i-check-mini"/></svg> </span>Scrapingdog Fix</span><p class="text-sm text-ink leading-[1.55] text-pretty">40M+ rotating proxies, browser rendering, and built-in anti-bot handling. Scrapingdog takes care of it automatically so your scraping never stops.</p></div></li><li class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border-soft bg-surface gap-4 lg:grid lg:grid-rows-subgrid lg:row-span-2 overflow-hidden p-5 relative sm:p-6"><span class="absolute pointer-events-none right-3 sm:right-4 -top-1 font-bold leading-none select-none text-brand-500/15" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:5rem;letter-spacing:-.04em">02</span><div class="flex flex-col relative gap-2.5"><h3 class="text-ink font-bold text-balance leading-[1.3] pr-12 sm:pr-14 sm:text-xl text-lg">You Waste Engineering Time Maintaining Scrapers</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-soft text-pretty leading-[1.55]">Headless browsers crash. Proxy providers go down at any time. CAPTCHAs appear randomly. Your team ends up fixing scrapers instead of building the product.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 p-4 bg-brand-50/60 border-brand-500 border-l-2 relative rounded-xl sm:p-4.5"><span class="items-center pl-1 bg-brand-500 font-bold gap-2 inline-flex pr-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] text-surface tracking-[0.12em] uppercase w-fit"><span class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-surface text-brand-500 h-5 w-5"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-3 w-3"><use href="#i-check-mini"/></svg> </span>Scrapingdog Fix</span><p class="text-sm text-ink leading-[1.55] text-pretty">One web scraping API replaces your entire scraping stack. Browser rendering, CAPTCHA handling, and retries are all managed automatically. Integrate in minutes.</p></div></li><li class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border-soft bg-surface gap-4 lg:grid lg:grid-rows-subgrid lg:row-span-2 overflow-hidden p-5 relative sm:p-6"><span class="absolute pointer-events-none right-3 sm:right-4 -top-1 font-bold leading-none select-none text-brand-500/15" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:5rem;letter-spacing:-.04em">03</span><div class="flex flex-col relative gap-2.5"><h3 class="text-ink font-bold text-balance leading-[1.3] pr-12 sm:pr-14 sm:text-xl text-lg">Costs Grow Fast When You Try to Scale Scraping</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-soft text-pretty leading-[1.55]">Scaling a scraper from 1,000 to 1,000,000 pages requires servers, proxy contracts, bandwidth, and dedicated engineers. Your infrastructure costs grow faster than your data.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 p-4 bg-brand-50/60 border-brand-500 border-l-2 relative rounded-xl sm:p-4.5"><span class="items-center pl-1 bg-brand-500 font-bold gap-2 inline-flex pr-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] text-surface tracking-[0.12em] uppercase w-fit"><span class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-surface text-brand-500 h-5 w-5"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-3 w-3"><use href="#i-check-mini"/></svg> </span>Scrapingdog Fix</span><p class="text-sm text-ink leading-[1.55] text-pretty">Pay only for successful requests, nothing wasted. Scale to millions of requests with zero infrastructure headaches.</p></div></li></ul></div></section><section class="sm:px-6 2xl:max-w-[1728px] 2xl:px-[92px] lg:px-10 max-w-7xl md:px-8 mx-auto px-4 xl:max-w-[1440px] xl:px-[80px] 2xl:py-20 lg:py-16 md:py-14 py-10 sm:py-12 xl:py-16 overflow-x-clip"><div class="flex flex-col gap-8 sm:gap-10 xl:gap-12"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 items-center text-center"><h2 class="text-ink font-bold text-balance leading-[1.3] 2xl:text-5xl md:text-[40px] sm:text-4xl text-3xl max-w-4xl">Everything Built In. Nothing to <span class="relative inline-block whitespace-nowrap"><img alt class="absolute pointer-events-none left-1/2 max-w-none top-1/2" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='166'%20height='40'%20fill='none'%20viewBox='0%200%20166%2040'%3e%3cpath%20fill='%233ea380'%20d='M104.296%2034.85c15.361-1.258%2027.08-2.523%2038.581-5.254%204.158-.966%208.193-2.415%2012.153-3.858%201.758-.664%203.393-1.813%204.796-3.01q3.583-3-.093-5.73c-1.557-1.197-3.401-2.225-5.232-3.113-4.843-2.228-10.056-3.571-15.256-4.773-12.881-2.947-26.071-4.376-39.338-5.018-15.092-.68-30.07-.165-45.07%201.697-11.027%201.34-21.995%203.312-32.744%205.972-6.08%201.503-12.152%203.077-18.23%204.58-.076.008-.151.015-.22.092-1.559.362-2.577.035-2.815-.864