4.069V2h-2v2.069A8.01 8.01 0 0 0 4.069 11H2v2h2.069A8.01 8.01 0 0 0 11 19.931V22h2v-2.069A8.01 8.01 0 0 0 19.931 13H22v-2h-2.069A8.01 8.01 0 0 0 13 4.069M12 18c-3.309 0-6-2.691-6-6s2.691-6 6-6 6 2.691 6 6-2.691 6-6 6" fill="currentColor"/></svg></div><h3 class="text-ink font-bold text-balance sm:text-lg text-base">Geotargeting</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-soft text-pretty leading-[1.55]">Get location specific data by routing requests through proxies in different countries. Useful for tracking localized prices, search rankings, and regional results.</p></article></li><li class="flex"><article class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border-soft p-4 sm:p-5 bg-surface-card duration-150 gap-2.5 group hover:bg-brand-50 sm:gap-3 transition-colors w-full"><div class="items-center justify-center shrink-0 inline-flex shadow-button [&>svg]:h-[18px] [&>svg]:w-[18px] bg-surface h-9 rounded-lg text-brand-500 w-9" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" height="24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M17 7c-2.094 0-3.611 1.567-5.001 3.346C10.609 8.567 9.093 7 7 7a5.006 5.006 0 0 0-4.623 6.913 5 5 0 0 0 1.082 1.621A4.96 4.96 0 0 0 6.99 17h.012c2.089-.005 3.605-1.572 4.996-3.351C13.389 15.431 14.906 17 17 17c2.757 0 5-2.243 5-5s-2.243-5-5-5M6.998 15l-.008 1v-1c-.799 0-1.55-.312-2.114-.878A3.004 3.004 0 0 1 7 9c1.33 0 2.56 1.438 3.746 2.998C9.558 13.557 8.328 14.997 6.998 15M17 15c-1.33 0-2.561-1.44-3.749-3.002C14.438 10.438 15.668 9 17 9c1.654 0 3 1.346 3 3s-1.346 3-3 3" fill="currentColor"/></svg></div><h3 class="text-ink font-bold text-balance sm:text-lg text-base">High Concurrency for Scalable Scraping</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-soft text-pretty leading-[1.55]">Scale from a few requests to millions without changing your code. Run multiple requests in parallel with built-in infrastructure handling.</p></article></li><li class="flex"><article class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border-soft p-4 sm:p-5 bg-surface-card duration-150 gap-2.5 group hover:bg-brand-50 sm:gap-3 transition-colors w-full"><div class="items-center justify-center shrink-0 inline-flex shadow-button [&>svg]:h-[18px] [&>svg]:w-[18px] bg-surface h-9 rounded-lg text-brand-500 w-9" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" height="24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M21.926 11.607c-.202-.488-.635-.605-.928-.633V8c0-1.103-.897-2-2-2h-6V4.61a1.49 1.49 0 0 0 .06-2.17 1.5 1.5 0 0 0-2.56 1.06c0 .442.195.836.5 1.11V6h-6c-1.103 0-2 .897-2 2v2.997l-.082.006a1 1 0 0 0-.928.997v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h.01v5c0 1.103.897 2 2 2h14c1.103 0 2-.897 2-2v-5a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1.938a1 1 0 0 0-.072-.455M4.998 20V8h14L19 11.996V20z" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M8.5 14c.828 0 1.5-.895 1.5-2s-.672-2-1.5-2-1.5.895-1.5 2 .672 2 1.5 2m7 0c.828 0 1.5-.895 1.5-2s-.672-2-1.5-2-1.5.895-1.5 2 .672 2 1.5 2M8 16h8v2H8z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></div><h3 class="text-ink font-bold text-balance sm:text-lg text-base">Anti-Bot Bypass</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-soft text-pretty leading-[1.55]">Advanced anti-bot handling with fingerprint rotation and human like request patterns to reduce blocks on protected websites.</p></article></li><li class="flex"><article class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border-soft p-4 sm:p-5 bg-surface-card duration-150 gap-2.5 group hover:bg-brand-50 sm:gap-3 transition-colors w-full"><div class="items-center justify-center shrink-0 inline-flex shadow-button [&>svg]:h-[18px] [&>svg]:w-[18px] bg-surface h-9 rounded-lg text-brand-500 w-9" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" height="24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M10 18a7.95 7.95 0 0 0 4.897-1.688l4.396 4.396 1.414-1.414-4.396-4.396A7.95 7.95 0 0 0 18 10c0-4.411-3.589-8-8-8s-8 3.589-8 8 3.589 8 8 8m0-14c3.309 0 6 2.691 6 6s-2.691 6-6 6-6-2.691-6-6 2.691-6 6-6" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M11.414 8.586c.379.38.588.882.588 1.414h2a3.98 3.98 0 0 0-1.174-2.828c-1.514-1.512-4.14-1.512-5.652 0l1.412 1.416c.76-.758 2.07-.756 2.826-.002" fill="currentColor"/></svg></div><h3 class="text-ink font-bold text-balance sm:text-lg text-base">Real Browser Rendering</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-soft text-pretty leading-[1.55]">We use headless Chrome so JavaScript-heavy and dynamic websites render exactly like a real browser. You get clean, complete data every time.</p></article></li><li class="flex"><article class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border-soft p-4 sm:p-5 bg-surface-card duration-150 gap-2.5 group hover:bg-brand-50 sm:gap-3 transition-colors w-full"><div class="items-center justify-center shrink-0 inline-flex shadow-button [&>svg]:h-[18px] [&>svg]:w-[18px] bg-surface h-9 rounded-lg text-brand-500 w-9" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" height="24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 3H4c-1.103 0-2 .897-2 2v11c0 1.103.897 2 2 2h7v2H8v2h8v-2h-3v-2h7c1.103 0 2-.897 2-2V5c0-1.103-.897-2-2-2M4 14V5h16l.002 9z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></div><h3 class="text-ink font-bold text-balance sm:text-lg text-base">40M+ Rotating Proxies</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-soft text-pretty leading-[1.55]">Requests automatically rotate across IPs, countries, and carriers so you never hit rate limits or bans.</p></article></li><li class="flex"><article class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border-soft p-4 sm:p-5 bg-surface-card duration-150 gap-2.5 group hover:bg-brand-50 sm:gap-3 transition-colors w-full"><div class="items-center justify-center shrink-0 inline-flex shadow-button [&>svg]:h-[18px] [&>svg]:w-[18px] bg-surface h-9 rounded-lg text-brand-500 w-9" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" height="24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m10 10.414 4 4 5.707-5.707L22 11V5h-6l2.293 2.293L14 11.586l-4-4-7.707 7.707 1.414 1.414z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></div><h3 class="text-ink font-bold text-balance sm:text-lg text-base">Built-in CAPTCHA Solving</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-soft text-pretty leading-[1.55]">When target websites throw CAPTCHA or other challenges, Scrapingdog solves them automatically in the background.</p></article></li></ul></div></section><section class="overflow-x-clip bg-surface-dark"><div class="flex flex-col gap-8 sm:gap-10 xl:gap-12 2xl:max-w-[1728px] 2xl:px-[92px] 2xl:py-20 lg:px-10 lg:py-16 max-w-7xl md:px-8 md:py-14 mx-auto px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 sm:py-12 xl:max-w-[1440px] xl:px-[80px] xl:py-16"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start md:gap-8 md:justify-between gap-6"><h2 class="leading-[1.3] font-bold text-balance 2xl:text-5xl md:text-[40px] sm:text-4xl text-3xl text-surface">Get Pre-Parsed <span class="relative inline-block whitespace-nowrap"><img alt class="absolute pointer-events-none left-1/2 max-w-none top-1/2" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='166'%20height='40'%20fill='none'%20viewBox='0%200%20166%2040'%3e%3cpath%20fill='%233ea380'%20d='M104.296%2034.85c15.361-1.258%2027.08-2.523%2038.581-5.254%204.158-.966%208.193-2.415%2012.153-3.858%201.758-.664%203.393-1.813%204.796-3.01q3.583-3-.093-5.73c-1.557-1.197-3.401-2.225-5.232-3.113-4.843-2.228-10.056-3.571-15.256-4.773-12.881-2.947-26.071-4.376-39.338-5.018-15.092-.68-30.07-.165-45.07%201.697-11.027%201.34-21.995%203.312-32.744%205.972-6.08%201.503-12.152%203.077-18.23%204.58-.076.008-.151.015-.22.092-1.559.362-2.577.035-2.815-.864-.388-.883.31-1.517%201.931-2.027%2010.347-2.904%2020.769-5.816%2031.353-7.822%2011.405-2.156%2022.857-3.82%2034.472-4.578C88.266-.176%20107.835.5%20127.32%203.452c7.702%201.175%2015.287%202.716%2022.659%205.198%203.375%201.165%206.633%202.695%209.816%204.232%201.352.65%202.601%201.806%203.618%202.913%202.286%202.473%202.35%205.514.09%208.069-1.301%201.47-2.998%202.767-4.797%203.79-4.167%202.454-8.824%203.75-13.495%204.906-15.146%203.506-30.474%205.117-45.957%205.892-6.27.317-12.538.634-18.82.811-8.1.21-16.283.355-24.41.284-7.67-.045-15.284-.307-22.925-.85-4.279-.299-8.605-