-.054a2.763 2.763 0 0 1 .006-5.526l44.896.054a2.762 2.762 0 1 1-.007 5.526Z" fill="#fff" stroke="#000"/><path d="m38.442 59.032-.768 6.25c-7.261-4.415-7.805-10.379-7.805-10.379 4.64 3.275 8.573 4.129 8.573 4.129m7.888-18.755a3.402 3.402 0 0 0 5.177 4.413z" fill="#000"/></svg></div><h3 class="text-ink font-bold sm:text-2xl text-xl mt-6">Price Monitoring</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-[1.7] text-ink-soft text-pretty mt-3">Track competitor prices across thousands of product pages daily. Scrapingdog handles pagination, authentication walls, and rate limits automatically.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col items-center text-center sm:items-start sm:text-left"><div class="[&>svg]:h-full [&>svg]:w-full shrink-0 h-[140px] w-[140px]"><img alt src="/_assets/tool.9_Lq38_d.svg" height="140" width="140" decoding="async" loading="lazy" aria-hidden="true"></div><h3 class="text-ink font-bold sm:text-2xl text-xl mt-6">Lead Generation</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-[1.7] text-ink-soft text-pretty mt-3">Collect structured contact data, company details, and decision-maker profiles from public directories and listing sites.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col items-center text-center sm:items-start sm:text-left"><div class="[&>svg]:h-full [&>svg]:w-full shrink-0 h-[140px] w-[140px]"><img alt src="/_assets/uc-31.Bp2CpBGa.svg" height="140" width="140" decoding="async" loading="lazy" aria-hidden="true"></div><h3 class="text-ink font-bold sm:text-2xl text-xl mt-6">Training AI Models</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-[1.7] text-ink-soft text-pretty mt-3">Gather high-quality, diverse web data to train, fine-tune, and evaluate large language models. Scrapingdog’s LLM-ready Markdown output.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col items-center text-center sm:items-start sm:text-left"><div class="[&>svg]:h-full [&>svg]:w-full shrink-0 h-[140px] w-[140px]"><img alt src="/_assets/trend.CGEDcPUI.svg" height="140" width="140" decoding="async" loading="lazy" aria-hidden="true"></div><h3 class="text-ink font-bold sm:text-2xl text-xl mt-6">Product Data Extraction</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-[1.7] text-ink-soft text-pretty mt-3">Extract images, descriptions, SKUs, attributes, and categories from e-commerce sites for catalog enrichment, marketplace.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col items-center text-center sm:items-start sm:text-left"><div class="[&>svg]:h-full [&>svg]:w-full shrink-0 h-[140px] w-[140px]"><img alt src="/_assets/rank-tracking.bfXum80g.svg" height="140" width="140" decoding="async" loading="lazy" aria-hidden="true"></div><h3 class="text-ink font-bold sm:text-2xl text-xl mt-6">SEO Monitoring</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-[1.7] text-ink-soft text-pretty mt-3">Scrape live SERP data to track keyword rankings, detect algorithm changes, monitor featured snippets, and benchmark against competitors.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col items-center text-center sm:items-start sm:text-left"><div class="[&>svg]:h-full [&>svg]:w-full shrink-0 h-[140px] w-[140px]"><img alt src="/_assets/academic.CgT2-Ydd.svg" height="140" width="140" decoding="async" loading="lazy" aria-hidden="true"></div><h3 class="text-ink font-bold sm:text-2xl text-xl mt-6">Building Apps</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-[1.7] text-ink-soft text-pretty mt-3">Power your SaaS product with live web data without building and maintaining your own scraping infrastructure.</p></li></ul></div></section><section class="overflow-x-clip bg-brand-50" data-astro-cid-j4tngfs4><svg aria-hidden="true" class="absolute" height="0" width="0" data-astro-cid-j4tngfs4=""><symbol id="i-check-round" viewBox="0 0 16 17" data-astro-cid-j4tngfs4=""><path d="M5.99982 10.2889L12.0715 4.72514C12.2093 4.59848 12.3848 4.53516 12.5978 4.53516C12.8109 4.53516 12.9866 4.59827 13.125 4.7245C13.2635 4.85072 13.3327 5.01138 13.3327 5.20647C13.3327 5.40154 13.2635 5.5624 13.125 5.68904L6.63235 11.6205C6.45163 11.7858 6.24078 11.8685 5.99982 11.8685C5.75886 11.8685 5.54802 11.785