ro-cid-j4tngfs4=""><use href="#i-check-round" data-astro-cid-j4tngfs4=""/></svg> <span class="text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed sm:text-base" data-astro-cid-j4tngfs4>API automatically adapts to layout changes</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 items-start" data-astro-cid-j4tngfs4><svg aria-hidden="true" class="text-brand-500 shrink-0 h-4 mt-0.5 w-4 sm:mt-1" data-astro-cid-j4tngfs4=""><use href="#i-check-round" data-astro-cid-j4tngfs4=""/></svg> <span class="text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed sm:text-base" data-astro-cid-j4tngfs4>Returns lean Markdown/JSON that fits your context window</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 items-start" data-astro-cid-j4tngfs4><svg aria-hidden="true" class="text-brand-500 shrink-0 h-4 mt-0.5 w-4 sm:mt-1" data-astro-cid-j4tngfs4=""><use href="#i-check-round" data-astro-cid-j4tngfs4=""/></svg> <span class="text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed sm:text-base" data-astro-cid-j4tngfs4>Built-in anti-bot &amp; JavaScript rendering, no extra tooling</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 items-start" data-astro-cid-j4tngfs4><svg aria-hidden="true" class="text-brand-500 shrink-0 h-4 mt-0.5 w-4 sm:mt-1" data-astro-cid-j4tngfs4=""><use href="#i-check-round" data-astro-cid-j4tngfs4=""/></svg> <span class="text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed sm:text-base" data-astro-cid-j4tngfs4>cURL, get, done, zero setup or maintenance</span></li></ul></div><div class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl overflow-hidden min-w-0 bg-code-bg shadow-[0_20px_40px_-12px_rgba(15,23,42,0.35)] lg:order-2 max-w-[550px] mx-auto order-1 w-full" data-astro-cid-j4tngfs4><div class="flex items-center shrink-0 border-b gap-2 px-4 sm:px-5 border-white/10 py-3" data-astro-cid-j4tngfs4><span class="rounded-full h-3 w-3 bg-window-close" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j4tngfs4></span> <span class="rounded-full h-3 w-3 bg-window-min" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j4tngfs4></span> <span class="rounded-full h-3 w-3 bg-window-max" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j4tngfs4></span></div><div class="relative code-sc