 href="#i-star"/></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><use href="#i-star"/></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><use href="#i-star"/></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><use href="#i-star"/></svg></div><p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-[1.7] text-ink-soft text-pretty">I’ve been using Scrapingdog for a few days and I’ve found it very user-friendly. Setting up my first data extraction was simple, and the interface makes it easy to understand each step.</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 mt-auto"><h3 class="text-ink font-bold sm:text-lg text-base">Liliane Pereira</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-soft">United States</p></div></article></li><li class="flex"><article class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:gap-5 h-full w-full bg-surface-card md:p-7 p-5 relative rounded-3xl sm:p-6"><img alt class="absolute pointer-events-none right-3 sm:right-4 h-9 md:h-11 md:right-5 md:top-5 sm:top-4 top-3 w-auto" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='69'%20height='42'%20fill='none'%20viewBox='0%200%2069%2042'%3e%3cg%20opacity='.1'%3e%3cg%20clip-path='url(%23a)'%3e%3cpath%20fill='%233ea380'%20d='M11.547%2041.2c0-.953-.075-1.75.034-2.522.047-.328.43-.68.744-.877%201.522-.966%203.176-1.739%204.595-2.848%204.594-3.591%207.317-8.319%207.466-14.461.041-1.743-.6-2.18-2.063-1.499-4.228%201.96-8.776.81-11.202-2.832-2.645-3.976-2.272-9.27.898-12.741%204.048-4.433%2010.712-4.567%2015.308-.33%202.751%202.537%204.06%205.813%204.386%209.54%201.093%2012.48-5.167%2022.77-16.564%2027.29-1.128.447-2.283.814-3.602%201.28'/%3e%3c/g%3e%3cg%20clip-path='url(%23b)'%3e%3cpath%20fill='%233ea380'%20d='M39.016%2041.2c0-.953-.076-1.75.034-2.522.047-.328.43-.68.744-.877%201.522-.966%203.175-1.739%204.595-2.848%204.594-3.591%207.316-8.319%207.466-14.461.041-1.743-.601-2.18-2.064-1.499-4.228%201.96-8.775.81-11.2-2.832-2.646-3.976-2.274-9.27.897-12.741%204.048-4.433%2010.712-4.567%2015.307-.33%202.752%202.537%204.06%205.813%204.386%209.54%201.095%2012.48-5.166%2022.77-16.563%2027.29-1.127.447-2.283.814-3.601%201.28'/%3e%3c/g%3e%3c/g%3e%3cdefs%3e%3cclipPath%20id='a'%3e%3cpath%20fill='%23fff'%20d='M0%200h41.2v41.2H0z'/%3e%3c/clipPath%3e%3cclipPath%20id='b'%3e%3cpath%20fill='%23fff'%20d='M27.469%200h41.2v41.2h-41.2z'/%3e%3c/clipPath%3e%3c/defs%3e%3c/svg%3e" height="42" width="69" aria-hidden="true"><div class="flex gap-1 text-accent-yellow" role="img" aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5 stars"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><use href="#i-star"/></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><use href="#i-star"/></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><use href="#i-star"/></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><use href="#i-star"/></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><use href="#i-star"/></svg></div><p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-[1.7] text-ink-soft text-pretty">Their API success rate is 100% on the tests that I have done. The service seems very reliable.</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 mt-auto"><h3 class="text-ink font-bold sm:text-lg text-base">Jomer Avengoza</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-soft">New York, USA</p></div></article></li><li class="flex"><article class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:gap-5 h-full w-full bg-surface-card md:p-7 p-5 relative rounded-3xl sm:p-6"><img alt class="absolute pointer-events-none right-3 sm:right-4 h-9 md:h-11 md:right-5 md:top-5 sm:top-4 top-3 w-auto" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='69'%20height='42'%20fill='none'%20viewBox='0%200%2069%2042'%3e%3cg%20opacity='.1'%3e%3cg%20clip-path='url(%23a)'%3e%3cpath%20fill='%233ea380'%20d='M11.547%2041.2c0-.953-.075-1.75.034-2.522.047-.328.43-.68.744-.877%201.522-.966%203.176-1.739%204.595-2.848%204.594-3.591%207.317-8.319%207.466-14.461.041-1.743-.6-2.18-2.063-1.499-4.228%201.96-8.776.81-11.202-2.832-2.645-3.976-2.272-9.27.898-12.741%204.048-4.433%2010.712-4.567%2015.308-.33%202.751%202.537%204.06%205.813%204.386%209.54%201.093%2012.48-5.167%2022.77-16.564%2027.29-1.128.447-2.283.814-3.602%201.28'/%3e%3c/g%3e%3cg%20clip-path='url(%23b)'%3e%3cpath%20fill='%233ea380'%20d='M39.016%2041.2c0-.953-.076-1.75.034-2.522.047-.328.43-.68.744-.877%201.522-.966%203.175-1.739%204.595-2.848%204.594-3.591%207.316-8.319%207.466-14.461.041-1.743-.601-2.18-2.064-1.499-4.228%201.96-8.775.81-11.2-2.832-2.646-3.976-2.274-9.27.897-12.741%204.048-4.433%2010.712-4.567%2015.307-.33%202.752%202.537%204.06%205.813%204.386%209.54%201.095%2012.48-5.166%2022.77-16.563%2027.29-1.127.447-2.283.814-3.601%201.28'/%3e%3c/g%3e%3c/g%3e%3cdefs%3e%3cclipPath%20id='a'%3e%3cpath%20fill='%23fff'%20d='M0%200h41.2v41.2H0z'/%3e%3c/clipPath%3e%3cclipPath%20id='b'%3e%3cpath%20fill='%23fff'%20d='M27.469%200h41.2v41.2h-41.2z'/%3e%3c/clipPath%3e%3c/defs%3e%3c/svg%3e" height="42" width="69" aria-hidden="true"><div class="flex gap-1 text-accent-yellow" role="img" aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5 stars"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><use href="#i-star"/></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><use href="#i-star"/></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><use href="#i-star"/></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><use href="#i-star"/></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><use href="#i-star"/></svg></div><p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-[1.7] text-ink-soft text-pretty">Reliable, and simple to use! It’s also inexpensive and has packaged solution for every needs (Google, LinkedIn). Highly recommend.</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 mt-auto"><h3 class="text-ink font-bold sm:text-lg text-base">John Tyler</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-soft">France</p></div></article></li><li class="flex"><article class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:gap-5 h-full w-full bg-surface-card md:p-7 p-5 relative rounded-3xl sm:p-6"><img alt class="absolute pointer-events-none right-3 sm:right-4 h-9 md:h-11 md:right-5 md:top-5 sm:top-4 top-3 w-auto" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='69'%20height='42'%20fill='none'%20viewBox='0%200%2069%2042'%3e%3cg%20opacity='.1'%3e%3cg%20clip-path='url(%23a)'%3e%3cpath%20fill='%233ea380'%20d='M11.547%2041.2c0-.953-.075-1.75.034-2.522.047-.328.43-.68.744-.877%201.522-.966%203.176-1.739%204.595-2.848%204.594-3.591%207.317-8.319%207.466-14.461.041-1.743-.6-2.18-2.063-1.499-4.228%201.96-8.776.81-11.202-2.832-2.645-3.976-2.272-9.27.898-12.741%204.048-4.433%2010.712-4.567%2015.308-.33%202.751%202.537%204.06%205.813%204.386%209.54%201.093%2012.48-5.167%2022.77-16.564%2027.29-1.128.447-2.283.814-3.602%201.28'/%3e%3c/g%3e%3cg%20clip-path='url(%23b)'%3e%3cpath%20fill='%233ea380'%20d='M39.016%2041.2c0-.953-.076-1.75.034-2.522.047-.328.43-.68.744-.877%201.522-.966%203.175-1.739%204.595-2.848%204.594-3.591%207.316-8.319%207.466-14.461.041-1.743-.601-2.18-2.064-1.499-4.228%201.96-8.775.81-11.2-2.832-2.646-3.976-2.274-9.27.897-12.741%204.048-4.433%2010.712-4.567%2015.307-.33%202.752%202.537%204.06%205.813%204.386%209.54%201.095%2012.48-5.166%2022.77-16.563%2027.29-1.127.447-2.283.814-3.601%201.28'/%3e%3c/g%3e%3c/g%3e%3cdefs%3e%3cclipPath%20id='a'%3e%3cpath%20fill='%23fff'%20d='M0%200h41.2v41.2H0z'/%3e%3c/clipPath%3e%3cclipPath%20id='b'%3e%3cpath%20fill='%23fff'%20d='M27.469%200h41.2v41.2h-41.2z'/%3e%3c/clipPath%3e%3c/defs%3e%3c/svg%3e" height="42" width="69" aria-hidden="true"><div class="flex gap-1 text-accent-yellow" role="img" aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5 stars"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><use href="#i-star"/></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><use href="#i-star"/></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><use href="#i-star"/></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><use href="#i-star"/></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><use href="#i-star"/></svg></div><p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-[1.7] text-ink-soft text-pretty">Amazing service. I am using it for Google Maps reviews and it works perfectly. I have also used Live chat and they were very fast and puctual on responses. 100% recommended.</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 mt-auto"><h3 class="text-ink font-bold sm:text-lg text-base">Pippo</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-soft">Italy</p></div></article></li></ul></div></section><section class="sm:px-6 2xl:max-w-[1728px] 2xl:px-[92px] lg:px-10 max-w-7xl md:px-8 mx-auto px-4 xl:max-w-[1440px] xl:px-[80px] 2xl:py-20 lg:py-16 md:py-14 py-10 sm:py-12 xl:py-16 overflow-x-clip"><div class="flex flex-col gap-8 sm:gap-10 xl:gap-12"><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center"><h2 class="text-ink font-bold text-balance leading-[1.3] 2xl:text-5xl md:text-[40px] sm:text-4xl text-3xl">The web&#39;s most loyal data <span class="relative inline-block whitespace-nowrap"><img alt class="absolute pointer-events-none left-1/2 max-w-none top-1/2" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='166'%20height='40'%20fill='none'%20viewBox='0%200%20166%2040'%3e%3cpath%20fill='%233ea380'%20d='M104.296%2034.85c15.361-1.258%2027.08-2.523%2038.581-5.254%204.158-.966%208.193-2.415%2012.153-3.858%201.758-.664%203.393-1.813%204.796-3.01q3.583-3-.093-5.73c-1.557-1.197-3.401-2.225-5.232-3.113-4.843-2.228-10.056-3.571-15.256-4.773-12.881-2.947-26.071-4.376-39.338-5.018-15.092-.68-30.07-.165-45.07%201.697-11.027%201.34-21.995%203.312-32.744%205.972-6.08%201.503-12.152%203.077-18.23%204.58-.076.008-.151.015-.22.092-1.559.362-2.577.035-2.815-.864-.388-.883.31-1.517%201.931-2.027%2010.347-2.904%2020.769-5.816%2031.353-7.822%2011.405-2.156%2022.857-3.82%2034.472-4.578C88.266-.176%20107.835.5%20127.32%203.452c7.702%201.175%2015.287%202.716%2022.659%205.198%203.375%201.165%206.633%202.695%209.816%204.232%201.352.65%202.601%201.806%203.618%202.913%202.286%202.473%202.35%205.514.09%208.069-1.301%201.47-2.998%202.767-4.797%203.79-4.167%202.454-8.824%203.75-13.495%204.906-15.146%203.506-30.474%205.117-45.957%205.892-6.27.317-12.538.634-18.82.811-8.1.21-16.283.355-24.41.284-7.67-.045-15.284-.307-22.925-.85-4.279-.299-8.605-1.09-12.78-1.894-2.01-.374-3.99-1.247-5.752-2.212-3.859-2.252-4.427-5.811-1.647-9.266%201.6