b)" title="Manthan Koolwal · LinkedIn"><span class="[&>svg]:h-full [&>svg]:w-full fill-current h-[18px] w-[18px]" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>LinkedIn</title><path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433a2.06 2.06 0 0 1-2.063-2.065 2.063 2.063 0 1 1 2.063 2.065m1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0z"/></svg></span></a><a href="https://x.com/KoolwalManthan" class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-full focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 border border-brand-100 focus-visible:outline-brand-text h-11 hover:bg-brand-100 hover:border-brand-text text-brand-text transition-colors w-11" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Manthan Koolwal on X (opens in a new tab)" title="Manthan Koolwal · X"><span class="[&>svg]:h-full [&>svg]:w-full fill-current h-[18px] w-[18px]" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>X</title><path d="M14.234 10.162 22.977 0h-2.072l-7.591 8.824L7.251 0H.258l9.168 13.343L.258 24H2.33l8.016-9.318L16.749 24h6.993zm-2.837 3.299-.929-1.329L3.076 1.56h3.182l5.965 8.532.929 1.329 7.754 11.09h-3.182z"/></svg></span></a></div></div><p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-[1.7] text-ink-soft text-pretty">I built Scrapingdog because I was tired of writing the same proxy rotation and anti-bot workarounds on every project. A decade in web data taught me that developers shouldn’t spend their time fighting infrastructure, they should spend it building. Scrapingdog is what I wish had existed from day one.</p></article><article class="flex flex-col items-center text-center bg-surface-card gap-5 md:gap-6 md:p-12 p-8 rounded-3xl sm:p-10"><div c